  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ADPEB Daycare Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This association has 70 orphans kids, most of them are either sick or need meds; the others dont have clothing or food to eat. They are planning to create a daycare center for poor families. Theyre giving opportunities for moms to find a job for a better life. This will have a high impact in an area where there is a need for children to receive quality education and parents to work. These benefits can translate into economic activity (no matter how small) for the city of Djibouti. The associations goal is to make these mothers self-sufficient so that they can provide for their families.</narrative>
  </description>
